'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 5''' was the fifth show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on September 13, 2026 at the Aizawa Municipal Gymnasium in [[Aizawa]] — the tournament's first night in the champion's home city, and the first of two consecutive nights at the venue. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block A]] Round 3 matches.

The night is remembered for three things: the family war — [[Leoni Masua]] vs. [[Kengo Vaiahi|Kengo]], the chief and the broken cousin, in the champion's backyard; [[Marcus Vance|Marcus "The Drill" Vance]] vs. [[Kawada Masahiro]] — two undefeated men, the workhorse and the strong-style ace; and the injury — [[Big Stan]], competing on a [[Big Stan knee injury (2026)|torn meniscus]], losing to [[Nakamura Shinsuke]] as the knee gave out, a loss that would end his tournament three days later.

